  "history": "First run (seed 0): 2/4. Three estimator defects were then fixed on principle, without changing any routing threshold: P used a diagonal Bhattacharyya coefficient that collapsed to ~1e-50 in 136 dimensions; D compared fresh windows with in-sample training distances; D read drift off the gesture in error, double-counting behavioural deviation. The physiological injection was changed from 30% finger reach, which produced one error, to two cues produced as one pattern. The cohort below was run once after those changes, over a seed list fixed beforehand."
